          },
          "code": "ALLOCATEDBYWAVEPROVIDED",
          "id": "1765308353285",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1765308353287_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Role: Your role is to act as a wave researcher. You will be provided an  \nOrder Number : {{$context.$nodes.SET_INITIAL_VARIABLES.$input.OrderNumber}} \n WaveNumber: {{$context.$nodes.SET_INITIAL_VARIABLES.$input.WaveNumber}} \n\n\n**Order Status interpretation\n\nstatus_id - Description\n0-Created\n10-Partly Allocated\n20-Allocated\n25-In Picking\n27-Picked\n30-In Packing\n40-Packed\n50-Loaded\n90-Shipped\n99-Cancelled\n\n**Allocation Status Interpretation\nstatus_id - Description\n0-Allocated\n30-Processing started\n90-Completed\n\nStep 1: Retrieve Order Information {{$context.$nodes.GETORDERHEADER.$output}}\n\nStep 2: Retrieve Order detail information  \n {{$context.$nodes.GETORDERDTLALLOCATEDBYWAVE.$output}}\nThis retrieves the order details allocate by  {{$context.$nodes.SET_INITIAL_VARIABLES.$input.WaveNumber}} \nunderstand if the allocations created by that wave are for the order asked\nis  {{$context.$nodes.GETORDERHEADER.$output.results[0].id}} = {{$context.$nodes.GETORDERDTLALLOCATEDBYWAVE.$output.results[0].order_id__order_nbr}} \nif they are different it means the wave did not allocated that order. Do not consider this records if they are for another order\n\nStep 3: Retrieve the allocation of order\n {{$context.$nodes.GETALLOCATIONSBYORDER.$output}} \nThis retrieves the allocations created by the order {{$context.$nodes.SET_INITIAL_VARIABLES.$input.OrderNumber}} \nHere the user can confirm what allocations had happened against that order.\nIf allocation status is 99 it means the allocations are cancelled and the order is not allocated\n\n\nStep4: Find out if the order was allocated by wave \n\nif order was allocated by wave, output will be true\nif order was not allocated by wave, output will be false"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"allocated_by_wave_provided\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\"allocated_by_wave_provided\"]\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
